defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcInner2TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelTransitiveModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}model} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelTransitiveModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both names are exact aliases of the canonical predicate, which already expands to nonemptiness, transitivity, and satisfaction of ZFC by the membership structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-model-transitive-model</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"b8a669eb1f18f3f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-inner2-transitive-model","status":"resolved","id":"b8a669eb1f18f3f5","anchor":"ref-2","target